    "bodySample": "‹‹ SALES ▾ FUNDING ▾ ⬡ Lenders ▩ Finance OS BETA ✒ Contracts ◍ Subscriptions BETA CLIENT OPS ▾ WATCH ▾ AUTOMATION ▾ MARKETING ▾ ADMIN ▾ PORTALS ▾ fundhub Beta — under development. Data may be incomplete or inaccurate. Do not use for client decisions. Dismiss SETUP Subscriptions ← Command Center · ← Client hub Subscriptions SUBSCRIPTIONS The plan this client is on, the price, and the card on file for it. Nothing on this page charges anybody. Starting, changing or cancelling a plan here writes down what the client is on. There is no card processor connected to this system, so no money moves and no invoice is raised. A card below is a reference to a card held by a processor — a token, plus the brand, last four digits and expiry so a person can tell one card from another. The card number itself is not here, is not asked for, and is refused if it is sent. Current plan No plan on file for this client. Nobody has recorded one yet — which is not the same as the client having cancelled. A cancelled plan appears in the history below with the date it stopped. Start a plan TIER PRICE (DOLLARS) CURRENCY Record this plan Leave the price empty if nobody has decided it yet. It is recorded as unknown and shown as an em dash — not as zero, which would say the plan is free. Version history Newest first. Every tier and price this client has been on, and the dates each one applied. No versions recorded. Once a plan is started, every price and tier it has ever had appears here with the dates it applied, so a change can be explained later. Cards on file A reference to a card held by a processor — never the card number. Taking a card off file does not delete it: a card that paid for something has to stay resolvable from the plan that used it. No cards on file for this client. BRAND LAST FOUR EXP MONTH EXP YEAR PROCESSOR PROCESSOR TOKEN Put this card on file The token is the reference a processor gave you for this card. It is not the card number, and a card number typed here is refused — not trimmed, not stored. Saving a token that is already on file updates the brand, last four and expiry and nothing else; it does not put a card that was taken off file back on it. Payment links 0 LINK(S) A Commas checkout link for one amount — a deposit, the diagnostic fee, a repair charge, or anything else. Unlike the plan above, this DOES move money: the client pays Commas directly, and this screen only records the ask and, once Commas tells us, the result. Create a link PURPOSE deposit diagnostic repair custom AMOUNT (DOLLARS) DESCRIPTION Create payment link Required for \"custom\" — for the other three purposes it is optional and defaults to the purpose name. Creating a link does not send it: copy it from the table below, or press Send to queue it through the messaging system. Links for this client No payment links created for this client yet. systems nominal · fundhub.ai TEST — Owner Role · owner · 34 tabs LIVE Sign out Search ⌘K live read · no plan recorded for this client · 0 card(s) on file · 0 payment link(s) on record Chat"
